{"id":"vod_md_4957","vodId":"4957","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"政宗君的复仇","name_cn":"政宗君的复仇","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230915-1/3e99d7082a57ed2968d6a1d2208d5db4.jpg"},"summary":"真壁政宗（花江夏树 配音）小时候是个小胖子，被同班同学取了“猪脚”的绰号，整日生活在自卑和嘲笑之中，之后，政宗转校，同时接受了为期八年的训练，终于恢复了正常人的身材，亦意外的发现自己其实拥有一副帅气的面孔。如今，政宗回到了曾经生活过的城市，满腔怒火的他制定了一系列报复计 划，发誓要让当年给他取绰号的女孩安达垣爱姬（大桥彩香 配音）体会一下他曾经体会过的屈辱。和政宗有着相似经历的千金大小姐藤之宫宁子（三森铃子 配音）、沉默寡言内向腹黑的小岩井吉乃（水濑祈配音）、沉迷于耽美文化的腐女子双叶妙（田所梓 配音），在这些可爱女孩子们的围绕下，政宗的复仇计划能够顺利实施吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-15 07:44:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/UGjIwpzs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/bpzKz8cL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/D7acqd1Q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/Ig1rK4au/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/Ppw99yNI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/pGzlZ740/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/BkhW1cgR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/ZcsQ7KLb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/Wirgig85/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/nVTF1YGl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/81GdSzHt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230913/tKFsXbUL/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:15.796Z"}